    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Products and Usage"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "What types of products do you sell?",
       "a_html": "<p>We offer a variety of cannabis products, including flowers, edibles, concentrates, topicals, tinctures, and accessories.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How do I choose the right product for me?",
       "a_html": "<p>Our knowledgeable staff can help you choose the right product based on your needs and experience level. You can also refer to our product descriptions and customer reviews.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "What is the difference between Indica, Sativa, and Hybrid strains?",
       "a_html": "<p><strong>Indica:</strong> Known for relaxing effects, ideal for evening use.</p><p><strong>Sativa:</strong> Known for uplifting and energizing effects, suitable for daytime use.</p><p><strong>Hybrid:</strong> A mix of Indica and Sativa, offering a balance of effects.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Purchasing and Payment"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Do I need a medical marijuana card to purchase?",
       "a_html": "<p>This depends on state laws. In some states, you can buy cannabis products for recreational use without a medical card, while others require one.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "What forms of payment do you accept?",
       "a_html": "<p>We accept cash and may also accept debit cards. Please check our website or contact us for the most up-to-date payment options.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can I place an order online?",
       "a_html": "<p>Yes, you can place an order online for in-store pickup or delivery (if available). Please visit our online shop for details.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Legal and Safety"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Is marijuana legal in my state?",
       "a_html": "<p>Marijuana laws vary by state. Please check your local regulations to understand the legality of cannabis in your area.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Is it safe to use cannabis?",
       "a_html": "<p>When used responsibly, cannabis is generally considered safe. However, it’s important to start with a low dose, especially if you’re a beginner, and be aware of potential side effects.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Delivery and Pickup"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Do you offer delivery?",
       "a_html": "<p>We offer delivery services in certain areas. Please check our delivery policy page for more information on availability and fees.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How does in-store pickup work?",
       "a_html": "<p>You can place your order online and select the in-store pickup option. You’ll receive a notification when your order is ready, and you can pick it up during our business hours.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Loyalty Programs and Discounts"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Do you have a loyalty program?",
       "a_html": "<p>Yes, we offer a loyalty program where you can earn points on purchases and redeem them for discounts on future orders. Sign up in-store or online to start earning points.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Are there any discounts available?",
       "a_html": "<p>We offer various discounts, including first-time customer discounts, veteran discounts, and daily deals. Check our promotions page for current offers.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Health and Wellness"
    },
    {
     "type": "faq",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Can cannabis be used for medical purposes?",
       "a_html": "<p>Yes, many people use cannabis for medical purposes, such as pain relief, anxiety reduction, and improved sleep. Consult with a healthcare professional to see if it’s right for you.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How do I store my cannabis products?",
       "a_html": "<p>Store your cannabis products in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and out of reach of children and pets.</p>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h3",
     "text": "Contact Us"
    },
    {
